      "text": [
        "Accelerating the Agent Development Lifecycle",
        "Build",
        "Build agents fast with or without code. Choose your model. Own your harness.",
        "Start with proven agent patterns, customize when you need control",
        "Own your harness, context, memory, and model choice",
        "Enable every team build to agents in natural language with Fleet",
        "Test",
        "Validate behavior before you ship. Turn traces into realistic datasets and eval every step.",
        "Debug agent runs with step-by-step tracing",
        "Query complex traces in under a second with SmithDB",
        "Turn expert review into standardized evals",
        "Deploy",
        "Ship agents on infra built for long-running tasks, persistent state, and secure execution.",
        "Build the right UX with 30+ Agent Server endpoints",
        "Standardize on one deployment pattern org-wide",
        "Run agent-generated code in isolated sandboxes",
        "Monitor",
        "Catch issues in production with online evals, dashboards, and alerts built for agents.",
        "Measure quality across production agent runs",
        "Catch regressions before users do",
        "Track cost, latency, errors, and tool behavior",
        "Iterate",
        "Compound agent intelligence through a feedback loop you own.",
        "Detect production issues automatically with Engine, the agent for agent engineering",
        "Find root causes and make targeted fixes",
        "Feed every fix back into your eval loop",
        "Govern",
        "Enforce cost limits and detect sensitive data before damage happens.",
        "Control model calls, spend, and sensitive data with LLM Gateway",
        "Require human approval for sensitive agent actions",
        "Deploy in SaaS, BYOC, or self-hosted environments"
      ]
    },
